    "number": 121,
    "summary": "Help comes from the Lord—He is the guardian of Israel.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "I will lift up mine eyes unto the hills, from whence cometh my help.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "Ps. 123:1."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "My help cometh from the Lord, which made heaven and earth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 7,
            "text": "Ps. 124:8."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 14
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "He will not suffer thy foot to be moved: he that keepeth thee will not slumber.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "Ps. 66:9."
          },
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 56,
            "text": "Ps. 127:1."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, he that keepeth Israel shall neither slumber nor sleep.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord is thy keeper: the Lord is thy shade upon thy right hand.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 22,
            "text": "OR watchman."
          },
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 45,
            "text": "Ps. 91:1."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 11
          },
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 35
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The sun shall not smite thee by day, nor the moon by night.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 7,
            "text": "Isa. 49:10; Rev. 7:16."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord shall preserve thee from all evil: he shall preserve thy soul.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 53,
            "end": 61,
            "text": "Ps. 97:10; D&C 45:46."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord shall preserve thy going out and thy coming in from this time forth, and even for evermore.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 52,
            "text": "Deut. 28:6."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
